# MsGenny: a compact sequence chart.
User, View, Autosave, Transport;

User => View : type;
View => Autosave : schedule();
Autosave -> Autosave : 1000 ms;
Autosave => View : save();
View => Transport : writeBinaryAtomic(path, bytes);
Transport >> View : ok;
--- : external change;
Transport -> View : modify event;
